    "detailed_description": "<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/988940/extras/4b833d5596da3df58204c0d60c9eaf69.avif?t=1746135135\" /></div><br><strong>Players can now choose between two campaigns- STORY MODE and CLASSIC MODE</strong><br><br><strong><i>STORY MODE</i> - Eight all new carefully handcrafted levels which progress in difficulty.</strong><br><strong><i>CLASSIC MODE</i> - The original campaign with open-ended exploration &amp; progression.</strong><br><br><strong>VIEW UNLOCKED SCENES IN THE BRAND NEW GALLERY &amp; MINIGAME MODES</strong></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Dark Alley Elf is an action-platformer featuring hot and heavy sexual content.<br><br>Take your trusty iron pipe and fight your way through several unique enemies, going from street to street until you reign the back alleys as slut supreme.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/988940/extras/ffdd2ecb0a85118798cdf2749042aa65.avif?t=1746135135\" /></div><br><br>In a modern-era world where fantasy races coexist peacefully alongside humans- Francesca the dark elf has found herself embroiled in a high stakes competition with her long time rival, famed company heiress Annabelle. The challenge? Be the one to earn the most money in a week's time.<br><br>Stacked against almost impossible odds, Francesca decides to do what she does best- practicing the world's oldest profession on the seedy big city streets. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/988940/extras/1529bc34e3cc71f2901de223b8e84b8f.avif?t=1746135135\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dark Alley Elf features a diverse grab bag of content and gameplay systems:</h2><br><br><strong><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><i>NAVIGATE</i> through the dangerous city streets and sewers!<br></li><li><i>SMASH</i> your way past an onslaught of lecherous thugs!<br></li><li><i>COLLECT</i> power-ups which aid you in your quest!<br></li><li><i>LUST</i> over a variety of hot interactive sex scenes!<br></li><li><i>JAM OUT</i> to a fully original soundtrack full of jazzy goodness!</li></ul></strong>",
